    "question": {
      ":question/id": "75264f36-960d-5b18-86df-0a9bd288660b",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following elementary row operations transforms the matrix $A$ into the matrix $B$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 10 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 10 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, notice that the $2$nd and $3$rd rows are the same in both matrices. The only row that has changed is the $1$st row.\n\nBy considering the given row operations that modify the $1$st row, we notice that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 10 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+{R}_{2} \\\\ & \\sim\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 10 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =B.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+{R}_{2}.\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "d791915a-8e8a-52a0-9191-2c0539833f17",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "29be6266-8d6b-5f88-8934-c2c77e1e99b2",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{3}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "1d350821-55aa-52ef-835a-f4869e21d552",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{R}_{2}:=\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot {R}_{2}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e227ed94-f8e3-54ad-ad53-d11f7ff6c884",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+{R}_{1}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e33c4798-ce4f-50b4-aeac-3d3d30954198",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+{R}_{2}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b23fa179-ae14-5ef4-9a7e-70502e84a616",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+\\left(-\\frac{3}{10}\\right)\\cdot {R}_{2}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "e33c4798-ce4f-50b4-aeac-3d3d30954198"
          ]
        }
      ]
